<article class="env-lemma" id="03OV">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/03OV">Lemma <span data-tag="03OV">59.19.1</span>.</a> The forgetful functor $\textit{Ab}(\mathcal{C})\to \textit{PAb}(\mathcal{C})$ transforms injectives into injectives. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is formal using the fact that the forgetful functor has a left adjoint, namely sheafification, which is an exact functor. For more details see Cohomology on Sites, Lemma <a href="/tag/03F6" data-tag="03F6">21.10.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>